+# V4 phenotype-bound own-history comparison
+
+Status: source qualification and detached feasibility, not a completed behavior study. V2 and V3 remain closed, separately preserved studies. This worktree starts from accepted main c775c8c92e8f5e625f8a3e861ef79200199b54df and carries the prior opt-in source only. No default foundation or retained creature is changed.
+
+## Prospective changes
+
+The CPU port identity is `cpu-phenotype-bound-stationary-own-history-advantage-v4`. The new core recipe V2 binds all 11 drive roles to the actual expressed phenotype, full chemistry graph, emitters, receptors, and biological-value profile. It rejects unsupported mutations and public homeostasis fields that disagree with graph-derived state. The frozen V1 circuit remains unchanged.
+
+Hunger, fatigue, fear, pain, loneliness and temperature stress remain burden signals weighted 1/7. ATP remains an availability signal weighted 1/7 with the explicitly engineered target 0.75. Drive Extension0 is boredom, species 22, and now has its inherited burden magnitude 0.08. Curiosity is regulatory, reproductive opportunity is not a burden, and unbound Extension1 is not a penalty. Praise is species 21 on endocrine Extension0, not drive Extension0. Knots, basis, 0.001 pressure quantum, gain 0.35 and cap 0.35 are unchanged. The seven-axis weights are not renormalized.
+
+The reader compares two independently retained raw own-history successors through the same native pressure circuit. It does not replace either raw vector with a scientist's control-subtracted label. Missing action or reference evidence has zero readout. It is a local predictive association, not isolated causal attribution. Body and organ reserve costs remain separately visible; flat ATP is not free cognition.
+
+V4 adds the actual targetless NO_LOCOMOTION candidate as own Noop. The primary receipt and every other channel must satisfy exact physical no-op checks: approved primitive, no target, no direction/payload, completed phase, no contact, displacement, grip transfer, stimulation, investigation or physical energy cost, and a genuine zero measured locomotion receipt. Canonical Idle is excluded because it is not an exact zero-effect no-op primitive. Real Approach remains unsupported even when blocked or displacement is zero. Rest remains a distinct own action. The adapter, selected channel, target, representative and measured-final-physiology bindings remain strict.
+
+## Detached feasibility before any new decision
+
+The fixed N2048 construction asset has SHA-256 `1d2978cbd857a7ca99dc1b2cf65be9f6ff417a6f78199282e0431b94332c9377`, construction seed 2026111301. Its engineered ActionCandidate aggregates are Rest lane 23 = 8, Inspect lane 18 = 8, Approach lane 23 = 6, Contact lane 23 = 6. All other ActionCandidate coordinates are zero and other genes are unchanged.
+
+The initial no-world-step detached test passed. It performs two actual CPU forwards on independent neural clones, preserves exact host and founder checkpoint bytes, and discards its diagnostic sampler draw. Rest logit is 4.536094, Inspect 4.512239, NO_LOCOMOTION 3.390938, and Approach 2.446794. The only independently enabled motor head is Locomotion. Its NO_LOCOMOTION probability is 0.702894, Approach 0.273435 and Avoid 0.023671. Pure Rest plus no locomotion has probability 0.282109; NO_LOCOMOTION as representative has probability 0.127700. These establish syntactic selection opportunity, not physical source admission or a trajectory prediction. The original preview's combined no-op statistic also included Idle; V4 excludes Idle and preserves the original diagnostic unchanged.
+
+Positive decoder genes do not imply positive readouts: Contact's aggregate gene 6 yields a negative activation-weighted coefficient of -1.032778. Actual motor-source activations and native per-head distributions are therefore logged, rather than reasoning only from gene signs.
+
+The fixed diagnostic performed 600 ordinary awake world ticks on a fresh fixture with no selected commands, drive overwrites, acquired sources or neural decisions. It measures actual juvenile physiology and repeats the detached forward with and without the unknown-history V4 port. Preparation aborts if the creature dies, sleeps, health falls below 0.95 or reserve below 0.35. It does not extend or retune preparation to obtain a gradient. Developmental expression floor 1 is an expression floor, not a concentration floor. Age 600 is not claimed to be adult. At that fixed state, three explicitly chosen physical-only branches on discarded clones compare Rest plus NO_LOCOMOTION, NO_POSTURE plus NO_LOCOMOTION, and NO_LOCOMOTION alone. They bind actual transaction body events and measured biology, require no neural-emitter work, and verify that the extra physical no-posture does not change biology. They perform no neural decision, envelope, source write or host cognitive charging and are never learning evidence. Actual Rest benefit must appear in measured fatigue, not merely an action label. The matched protocol below is separately fixed before any neural life.
+
+## Work and preservation
+
+The native active-coordinate arithmetic retains its existing real SpMV, dendritic and finalization work. Full scratch work remains available as a reference, not a claimed brain microstep count. Binding executes once per decision, not once per candidate. Its explicit V4 semantic tariff charges one existing memory-context operation per encoded value, per eight encoded hash bytes, per state-validation/homeostasis-derivation call, per evaluated receptor and per copied/compared component. Context hashing separately charges one memory-context operation per eight serialized bytes. V4 also charges the separately counted scratch initialization, copies, zeroing, coordinate checks and tracking as memory operations; the frozen V1 conversion remains unchanged. These are declared semantic charges, not measured hardware instructions or elapsed-time estimates. They reach both existing ATP admission and final body cognitive charging. Prepared source contexts are reused for acquisition so the full context is not rehashed after the final charge.
+
+Off, unknown and zero-gain arms still execute and pay the declared reader work. No ATP rate discount or altered world chemistry is introduced. The decision receipt exposes binding bytes, operations, reader work and native arithmetic. Source diagnostics expose body and all six organ energies before the world interval, after it, and after final host charging.
+
+The port remains CPU-only, fresh-only and process-local. It cannot use legacy checkpoints, PPO/backward, GPU deployment or default host export paths. No GPU parity or learned policy competence is claimed. Before any future live attempt, final source, plan, asset and executable must be bound, and the executable copied outside Cargo target. No closed life is rerun.
+
+## Sleeping-context scope
+
+The V4 context retains exact `body.sleeping`. In the awake CPU action path, the previous flag is not itself read by the next physical action or biological update. Body application overwrites it from the new recovery event; Awake and Sleeping emitters then receive the newly computed body. Sealing the CPU sleep controller's phase does not clear this last-interval body flag.
+
+This does not establish that all prior sleep state is irrelevant. Before updating chemistry, a recovery interval reads the preceding graph's SleepMetabolicRate, regulated by species 20 SleepState. A waking interval explicitly uses rate 1. The present associative locality binds drive/hormone projections but not every latent chemical concentration, so the exact body flag conservatively separates histories with potentially different prior regulation. A future explicitly versioned abstraction could bind the causal regulation directly after validation; V4 does not remove this gate.
+
+The separate GPU `scheduled_tick_with_organism` helper also reads `before.body_sleeping` when choosing its recovery event. Therefore this is not a global telemetry-only claim or evidence of a host/world inconsistency. Compatible Rest and Noop histories may require naturally recurring prior body states, not merely one occurrence of each action name. If initial fatigue is already relieved before compatible evidence exists, the bounded attempt must preserve that null rather than extend its horizon.
+
+## Qualified mechanism and prospective matched protocol
+
+The fixed prepared diagnostic measured fatigue 0.037052475, ATP 0.645887554, body reserve 0.791745007, health 1, injury 0 and boredom 0.120000884. Maturation was 0.328947365: this is a juvenile. Rest emitted recovery 1 and reduced fatigue to zero. The true Noop interval left fatigue 0.037130617 and raised boredom by approximately 0.0002. Both physical-only branches had identical measured body/organ reserve changes; neither includes host cognitive charging. The peer contributed ordinary ambient contact in every branch, so these are not isolated social-action effects.
+
+At this state, total planned cognitive debit was 7,362 Q16 ATP (0.112335), compared with 1,777 Q16 without the port and 42,328 available. Four reader rows incurred 21,627 memory operations: 7,554 binding, 3,549 context and four times 2,631 scratch operations. Binding encoded 48,676 bytes and 1,413 values. This is the intentionally uncached, fully priced V4 diagnostic. Any later immutable-binding cache is a separate source revision with current-state validation and real phenotype/role invalidation; no discount is applied to this study.
+
+`PROTOCOL.json` fixes sampling seed 2026111303, construction seed 2026111301 and the exact inherited asset above. The two fresh arms run gain 0 followed by gain 0.35, at most 12 host intervals each after the same ordinary 600-tick preparation. Initial pure Rest and own-Noop selection probabilities are 0.282002 and 0.130667. All native alternatives remain available. These probabilities establish opportunity, not a quota or forecast. Both arms execute identical declared reader workloads; any trajectory-dependent differences in actual work are reported.
+
+The protocol preserves health 0.95, reserve 0.35, any-injury/death and autonomous sleep-controller safeguards. A host or affordability error ends its arm without replacement. The last-interval body sleeping flag alone is not a sleep-controller stop, and its exact associative-context gate remains unchanged. A source/protocol/asset/executable freeze precedes a durable no-retry marker. The executable is copied outside Cargo target before running. No replayed or reconstructed replacement life is allowed.
+
+The local journal records actual physical provenance, source/support rejection, native logits and head probabilities, final charged biology, body/organ costs and exact founder/optimizer preservation. A same-row counterfactual restores only reader-affected logits to their recorded base values and uses the actual draw. It can establish a local choice effect, not an alternate successful trajectory. Meaningful support requires distinct genuinely acquired compatible Rest and Noop histories; self-reference and action names alone are insufficient. If fatigue or support is exhausted first, preserve the null. Raw vectors and journals remain local and are not publication artifacts.
